          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 1,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "This tutorial focuses on the GitHub hosting, but you can adapt it with little tweak to any other CI/CD platform."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 3,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 3,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Preface"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 5,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 5,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Be sure you have added your Capacitor app first to Capgo, this tutorial just focuses on the upload phase.\nIf you need to add your app to Capgo, you can follow this "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
